{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_027_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7b04c1cb6ec64ca880575b9fc776afb3d4fe14ccaa9d15295e114f7ed2e235b2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd77a9751d2ef97afadc5e0593891d4a1e0d0dcc1b0048184c97b0d521afcb1",
      "text": "啊，找到你了。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35cbf78966a2900f6424315c93ef12fb2ed4c6252b4f423b92e3da5b671d4a83",
      "text": "给，这个。\n是白色情人节的礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290338bc5e369b01c9fdcfd23b1ed89920cea0b566acbe57a14d13bfcc633c04",
      "text": "情人节那天谢谢你。\n那是非常配红茶的、超级美味的巧克力哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a4f13dfec18d0948d236ac1df01b2c4683b851cfb2b29b0012a8f47cd63f02",
      "text": "我按照足以配得上●●●●プロデューサー回礼的标准\n挑选出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e08ada5f2f6c879f96f0383b3a61e44011b8a96c714e8f20337d239f3ab52f",
      "text": "要是能把我的感谢之情传达给你的话，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4234de06cf39e50109a774ae1f12bd2dd494580b5f155d565a958507e40ff5f",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n百忙之中特地把你叫出来真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38de8a77e7d0670251537a6d8ce79c89d481017cdf57bfcffddb30abc2d4f4a3",
      "text": "其实我是想把情人节巧克力的\n回礼送给制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:960bebfa87344a863b27524996fe81cb6264b6b2ebae810c48b2b024dfe2a434",
      "text": "我以自己的方式，挑选了感觉你会喜欢的礼物哦。\n还请一定要收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb66c8300e5b90e8078ac36b53226814c56be562da3f0d61069156d13199f66",
      "text": "真的可以吗？非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3bb09e7f7de5fb9d7ac77a4047aa2272b30be95b7caffedcc3edf83eab470e3",
      "text": "超级开心。那我就收下啦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ed618e8c9bca331c01fed5b37c00ed0e2a307bf4df4b56dc771c0cfb3de7c15",
      "text": "哈哈，能看到制作人开心的笑容，\n我特意准备这份礼物也就很有意义了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ed618e8c9bca331c01fed5b37c00ed0e2a307bf4df4b56dc771c0cfb3de7c15",
      "text": "哈哈，能看到制作人开心的笑容，\n我特意准备这份礼物也就很有意义了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c793d9fecc1258892968389ab2209a58607ada41e1e6615fc975ee850f1f8c26",
      "text": "还有，这个和情人节回礼是两码事。\n是我的一点特别服务哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f75de75ffe183946921dfd6a737bc09c46a7cf6b656945e0247c669fb4fbe4",
      "text": "只有在这个时节才能品尝到的特别逸品……\n是大吉岭初摘茶（First Flush）哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21a77f4d16ba12f48f2799debccd07e28f21e26fec65ba0054312e74d5676661",
      "text": "这款红茶，有着能让人感受到季节之始的\n清爽风味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646c6dbf440422739c438d001862b970db3d614ba2795a2262c104e872b72d1f",
      "text": "来吧，这是专门为●●●●プロデューサー冲泡的\n红茶。趁热请慢用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_22:5_02_027_22_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dc33d8095baf3debea4b48b41c12277de8b81090d345b989354ccdf525ffbce",
      "text": "要是能传达出我的感激之情就好了呢。\n今后也请多关照啦，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
